    "text": "By South Carolina Public Radio ,\n7 hours ago By late morning, the 500 block of West Rutledge Ave. was quiet and still. Little evidence existed, outside of the collection of news vans parked in the Gaffney Senior Center lot across from the Granard Courts Apartments, that a 17-year-old had died here on his way to school this morning. Read full article",
